UNIT_ID: U-007
NAME: SFT Does Not Improve Grounding, PO Erodes It
LENS: LENS_SYSTEM
TYPE: evidence_result
STATUS: SOURCE_SUPPORTED
FUNCTION: Izolacja wpływu supervised fine-tuning (SFT) i preference optimization (PO: DPO, PPO) na grounding agreement: SFT nie poprawia κ, PO zmniejsza base rate i κ grounding acts; preference datasets signalują, że asking questions is dispreferred.
MINIMAL_FORM:
  - SFT on UltraChat (Mistral 7B): Pearson correlation ≈ 0 between SFT checkpoints and κ; p>0.1
  - DPO on UltraFeedback: negative correlation (R=-0.70 to -0.89, p<0.05) across grounding acts
  - UltraFeedback: questions less frequent in preferred (13.77%) vs dispreferred (18.35%) examples, χ²=484.08, p<0.00001
